Version 4
SHEET 1 2500 1500
TEXT 80 40 Left 2 ;SENSITIVE DEPENDENCE ON INITIAL CONDITIONS (THE BUTTERFLY EFFECT DEMO)

* DC SUPPLIES
TEXT 80 120 Left 2 ;[DC POWER RAILS]
SYMBOL voltage 100 180 R0
SYMATTR InstName Vpos_src
SYMATTR Value 9
WIRE 100 196 100 160
FLAG 100 160 Vpos
WIRE 100 276 100 310
FLAG 100 310 0

SYMBOL voltage 100 360 R0
SYMATTR InstName Vneg_src
SYMATTR Value 9
WIRE 100 376 100 340
FLAG 100 340 0
WIRE 100 456 100 490
FLAG 100 490 Vneg

TEXT 360 80 Left 2 ;[SYSTEM A: INITIAL CONDITION Vc1 = 0.100000 V]

* --- System A ---
FLAG 380 180 Vc1_A
WIRE 380 180 500 180
SYMBOL cap 364 180 R0
SYMATTR InstName C1_A
SYMATTR Value 10n
SYMATTR SpiceLine ic=0.100000
WIRE 380 244 380 280
FLAG 380 280 0

SYMBOL res 484 164 R0
SYMATTR InstName R_pot_A
SYMATTR Value 1.75k

FLAG 500 260 Vc2_A
WIRE 500 260 660 260
SYMBOL cap 644 260 R0
SYMATTR InstName C2_A
SYMATTR Value 100n
SYMATTR SpiceLine ic=0
WIRE 660 324 660 360
FLAG 660 360 0

WIRE 660 260 820 260
SYMBOL ind 804 244 R0
SYMATTR InstName L1_A
SYMATTR Value 18m
SYMATTR SpiceLine Rser=12.5 ic=0
WIRE 820 340 820 360
FLAG 820 360 0

* Kennedy Op-Amp 1
SYMBOL Opamps\\AD712 1160 200 R0
SYMATTR InstName U1_A
SYMATTR Value AD712
FLAG 1128 280 Vc1_A
FLAG 1160 232 Vpos
FLAG 1160 296 Vneg
FLAG 1192 264 out1_A
FLAG 1128 248 n1_A

WIRE 1128 248 1056 248
WIRE 1056 248 1056 336
SYMBOL res 1040 320 R0
SYMATTR InstName R1_A
SYMATTR Value 1k
FLAG 1056 416 0

WIRE 1056 248 1156 248
WIRE 1156 248 1156 336
SYMBOL res 1140 320 R0
SYMATTR InstName R2_A
SYMATTR Value 6.5k
WIRE 1156 416 1260 416
WIRE 1260 416 1260 264
WIRE 1260 264 1192 264

WIRE 1260 264 1296 264
WIRE 1296 264 1296 336
SYMBOL res 1280 320 R0
SYMATTR InstName R3_A
SYMATTR Value 18k
FLAG 1296 416 Vc1_A

* Kennedy Op-Amp 2
SYMBOL Opamps\\AD712 1660 200 R0
SYMATTR InstName U2_A
SYMATTR Value AD712
FLAG 1628 280 Vc1_A
FLAG 1660 232 Vpos
FLAG 1660 296 Vneg
FLAG 1692 264 out2_A
FLAG 1628 248 n2_A

WIRE 1628 248 1556 248
WIRE 1556 248 1556 336
