SYMATTR Value 2k
WIRE 1656 416 1760 416
WIRE 1760 416 1760 264
WIRE 1760 264 1692 264

WIRE 1760 264 1796 264
WIRE 1796 264 1796 336
SYMBOL res 1780 320 R0
SYMATTR InstName R6_A
SYMATTR Value 2.5k
FLAG 1796 416 Vc1_A

TEXT 360 560 Left 2 ;[SYSTEM B: INITIAL CONDITION Vc1 = 0.100001 V (+1 uV PERTURBATION)]

