* Difference Generator
TEXT 2000 80 Left 2 ;[DIVERGENCE METRIC]
SYMBOL bv 2050 180 R0
SYMATTR InstName B_delta
SYMATTR Value V=V(Vc1_A)-V(Vc1_B)
WIRE 2050 196 2050 150
FLAG 2050 150 V_delta
WIRE 2050 276 2050 310
FLAG 2050 310 0

TEXT 80 1100 Left 2 ;[SIMULATION DIRECTIVES]
TEXT 80 1140 Left 2 !.tran 0 60m 0 5u uic
TEXT 80 1180 Left 2 !.options method=gear maxstep=5u
TEXT 80 1220 Left 2 !.lib ADI1.lib
TEXT 80 1260 Left 2 !.ic V(Vc1_A)=0.100000 V(Vc2_A)=0 I(L1_A)=0 V(Vc1_B)=0.100001 V(Vc2_B)=0 I(L1_B)=0
